  "diagnosis": "The postcondition forall i :: n<= i < a.Length ==> a[i]>=key does not follow from the loop invariants and exit condition. The loop only tracks that indices below lo are < key; it never tracks that indices from hi to a.Length are >= key. When the loop exits with lo==hi, there is no information about a[lo..a.Length], so the postcondition cannot be bridged."}

